[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }AI-generated changes still require verification before integration; Anthropic’s security guidance assigns users responsibility for reviewing proposed code and advises reviewing all suggested changes before approval. Line count does not represent the security, correctness, authorization, configuration, dependency, or operational impact of a change, so it cannot safely determine whether review may be bypassed. Automated review can supplement, but does not replace, existing manual code-review and security practices.

