[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Evaluation requires predefined, measurable success criteria and an evaluation set that reflects the intended task distribution, including edge cases. Metrics and slices establish what will be measured, while curated reference labels enable the resulting outputs to be scored. Aggregating scores, reviewing failures, and publishing dashboard results occur after the deployment has been run on that dataset.

