[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R17ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R17ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Pre-processing prepares invoice inputs for inference, including OCR and redacting sensitive text before model invocation. The model stage performs the Claude classification and structured-data extraction. Post-processing validates extracted output against its schema and persists only validated records to the system of record.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
